# MASTER PROMPT: BhoomiPlots Production CDN Traffic, Bot Activity & Vercel Usage Root-Cause Audit

You have access to the BhoomiPlots project source code, deployment configuration, and available production/deployment tools. Your task is to conduct a thorough, evidence-based audit to determine why the website is receiving a high number of CDN/Edge Requests and why the Vercel Hobby plan fair-use limit has been exceeded.

## IMPORTANT: AUDIT FIRST — DO NOT MODIFY ANYTHING

Start with investigation and diagnosis only.

Do not edit source files, change configurations, create deployments, pause/resume deployments, modify DNS, change firewall rules, block bots, or make production changes during this audit.

Do not assume the cause based on dashboard screenshots alone. Inspect the available evidence and distinguish confirmed findings from hypotheses. If access to any required logs or dashboards is unavailable, state that limitation explicitly.

